emo contains 30 unique levels that will challenge you to master all of Tricula's abilities in order to conquer this grid-based 2D puzzle platformer world of his.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game was made using the Godot Engine.</p>",
